{"version":1,"content":"<p>歌手張天賦（MC）首登內地央視綜藝節目被指為港爭光，卻引爆網民群起「篤灰」，指他所屬的華納唱片公司曾打正「暫緩北上」的旗號，過去兩年卻「偷運」旗下歌手內地開騷狂賺「人仔」，更為同樣到內地發展卻遭網暴公審的楊千嬅及炎明熹出口氣。</p><p>&lt;br/</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-16T16:21:01.021188+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":118,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-16T16:00:24+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-16T16:14:12.750253+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-16T16:14:12.750253+00:00","content_hash":"40b30413275bfa541dbd6f11cae6fba68c5b4f195885fe4d85636d615739dae6","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}